## Backend (trong NextJS)

| Công nghệ | Mục đích | Khi nào dùng |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Route Handlers** (`app/api/...`) | REST API cho Web + Mobile | CRUD, auth, business logic |
| **Prisma ORM** | Schema DB, migration, type-safe query | Mọi DB operation |
| **bcrypt / argon2** | Hash password one-way | Register/login *(Day 07)* |
| **jsonwebtoken / jose** | Sign/verify JWT access + refresh | Auth *(Day 06)* |
| **Middleware Next.js** | Chặn route protected, check token | Admin pages, API guard |

